&lt;p&gt;IMC is looking for a talented and analytically driven Trading Analyst in New York to join our systematic equities business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Trading team is responsible for overseeing the real-time trading, performance, and risk of our systematic strategies. Working closely with quantitative researchers, senior leaders, execution engineers, and external partners, the team makes time-sensitive decisions to ensure strategies operate effectively, respond to changing market conditions, and identify opportunities to improve trading performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Core Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real-Time Trading Oversight: Monitor live systematic trading strategies, identify anomalies, and take timely action to ensure operational stability and continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Management: Monitor portfolio exposures, trading activity, and risk limits, escalating and responding to potential risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Analysis: Analyze trading performance, P&amp;amp;L, execution quality, and market behavior to identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research Collaboration: Work closely with quantitative researchers to investigate trading outcomes, evaluate strategy behavior, and support ongoing optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
