&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Skills and Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in a trading analyst, trade support, or trading operations role at a bank or trading firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative and analytical skills, with a degree in Mathematics, Computer Science, Physics, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in financial markets, systematic trading, and quantitative research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment and the ability to make effective decisions under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity, attention to detail, and a proactive approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to collaborate across trading, research, and technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
